HINT:  Add a WHERE clause on the partition key to enable partition pruning.
SELECT * FROM pfr_test WHERE id = 1;
NOTICE:  One or more columns in the following table(s) do not have statistics: pfr_test
HINT:  For non-partitioned tables, run analyze <table_name>(<column_list>). For partitioned tables, run analyze rootpartition <table_name>(<column_list>). See log for columns missing statistics.
ERROR:  partitioned table "public.pfr_test" full partition scan is not allowed, 3 partitions would be scanned
HINT:  Add a WHERE clause on the partition key to enable partition pruning.
